   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "solange, sobald and als ob",
     "texto": [
      "1. **solange**: marks that the main action extends for as long as the subordinate clause lasts: **Solange die Debatte andauert, wird nicht abgestimmt** (as long as the debate continues, no vote will be taken).",
      "2. **sobald**: indicates immediate chronological succession: **Sobald der Entwurf vorliegt, prüfen wir ihn** (as soon as the draft is available, we will examine it).",
      "3. **als ob**: introduces an unreal or feigned situation using the **Konjunktiv II**: **Er spricht, als ob er der einzige Experte wäre** (he speaks as if he were the only expert)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Structure",
     "columnas": [
